546416025\",\"child_ids\":{\"ewllh0qqr0dT1711546416025\":[]},\"contents\":{\"ewllh0qqr0dT1711546416025\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003ch2 class=\\\"custom-heading-cls\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e收集执灯人誓言\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e使用\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"505971\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/08/29/50494840/580bb3983dcd02b1deee98cbdab99f0b_8777161852000493899.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"菲林斯\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505971/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505971/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e菲林斯\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e与八盏\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"506515\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/317305234/bab394c9d5d42011911d5b20bf5173b0_4384917809937193340.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"誓言之灯【挪德卡莱】\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506515/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506515/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e誓言之灯【挪德卡莱】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e交互\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\\\"custom-heading-cls\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e与菲林斯对话\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：这样的提灯我们已经见过好几盏了，看样式它们应该是执灯人部队的灯吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：灯上的字不知道有什么意义，我们找人问问看吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：和我们认识，又熟悉执灯人的事情…有了，我们去终夜长茔找菲林斯吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：你好，我的朋友，很高兴与你墓里再会。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e向菲林斯描述了你所见到的「誓言之灯」与灯上不明意义的话语。\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：「风已醒来，落叶飞旋」…这是人们在加入执灯人时立下的誓言。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：平时每一个执灯人成员都会随身携带自己的灯，只有在最无奈的情况下，他们才会放弃照看自己的灯。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：每一盏无主的灯恐怕都意味着一桩不幸，我很遗憾。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：不过早在立誓之时，他们就已经明白这种命运无可避免。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：如果说还有什么我们能为他们做的事，那就只有铭记了，铭记他们的誓言吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：「守护永燃的希望」…这是他们最大的愿望。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"4059","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1771913714","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"95","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"771","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1367","pos":"left"},{"id":"1368","pos":"right"},{"id":"1369","pos":"left"},{"id":"1370","pos":"left"},{"id":"1371","pos":"right"},{"id":"1372","pos":"banner"},{"id":"4059","pos":"banner"},{"id":"1373","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"43","name":"任务","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key":"任务","is_hidden":false,"parent_id":"189","template_id":"","bg_img":"","ch_ext":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"每行个数\",\"attribute_key\":\"col_per_row\",\"value\":\"2\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"展示样式\",\"attribute_key\":\"display_type\",\"value\":\"default\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"跳转链接\",\"attribute_key\